    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33302" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pācĭfĭcātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		pacifico, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a peacemaking</i>, <i>pacification</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spes pacificationis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 7, 8, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opem et gratiam alicujus ad pacificationem
