				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 9, 11, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Fam. 10, 27, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ubi ista pacificatio perpetrari nequivit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					7, 3, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
